Error [E0118]: The name `x` is already taken here
  --> refutable_bind_same_name_shadow.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |     x == .Val(x) ?? return 0
    |               ^
 Why: Inside one function, each name refers to exactly one thing
 Fix: Pick a different name, or assign to the existing one with `x = ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0118
